{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">TRANSACTION function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310850","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/TRANSACTION-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/TRANSACTION-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"TRANSACTION-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">TRANSACTION function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TRANSACTION-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns a LOGICAL value that indicates whether\na transaction is currently active.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TRANSACTION-function__syntax_GC1C1A52705180\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d456699e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"TRANSACTION-function__idGDP30N2677440\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>TRANSACTION</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TRANSACTION-function__notes_GC1C1A62705184\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d456699e122\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">The\nTRANSACTION function replaces <span class=\"ph filepath\">istrans.p</span>, which\nwas used in Progress Version 6 and earlier to determine whether\na transaction was active.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TRANSACTION-function__see-also_GC1C1A72705190\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d456699e134\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Transaction-object-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Transaction-object-handle.html\">Transaction object handle</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TO-ROWID-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TO-ROWID-function.html\">TO-ROWID function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TRANSACTION-MODE-AUTOMATIC-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TRANSACTION-MODE-AUTOMATIC-statement.html\">TRANSACTION-MODE AUTOMATIC statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310850","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"TRANSACTION function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TRANSACTION-function.html","type":"Manual"}